/**
 * @example tutorial.dox
 *
 * A complete example of measuring food volume with food_volume_measure.
 *
 * This example takes an empty-oven baseline and a food point cloud from a fixed
 * depth camera, then runs the IM pipeline and prints the measured volume.
 *
 * @include demo.cxx
 *
 * @par Description:
 * - First, obtain the baseline and food point clouds from the depth camera.
 * - Then, call VolumePipeline::measure() to run the end-to-end pipeline.
 * - Finally, read the volume from the returned VolumeEstimate.
 *
 * @note Link against the food_volume_measure library when compiling.
 */